                <description>Source clock selection for PLL3
Written by software to select the PLL3 clock source.
In order to save power, when PLL3 is not used, PLL3SRC[1:0] must be set to '11'.</description>
                <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
                <bitWidth>2</bitWidth>
                <access>read-write</access>
