                <description>PLL3 DIVQ divider output enable
Set and reset by software to enable the pll3_q_ck output of the PLL3.
Cleared by hardware when entering a Stop mode or Standby.
In order to save power, when the pll3_q_ck is not needed, DIVQEN and DIVQ must be set to '0'.</description>
                <bitOffset>5</bitOffset>
