                <name>DIVN</name>
                <description>Multiplication factor for PLL3 VCO
Written by software to control the multiplication factor of the VCO.
Warning: the software has to set correctly these bits to ensure that the VCO output frequency
is between its valid frequency range, which is between 400 and 800 MHz.
VCO output frequency = Fref3_ck x (DIVN+1), when value 0 has been loaded into FRACV, with:
- Valid division ratios for DIVN: between 25 and 200
- The input frequency Fref3_ck between 4 and 16 MHz
