              </field>
              <field>
                <name>SSCG_CTRL</name>
                <description>Clock Spreading Generator of PLL4 enable
Set and reset by software to enable the clock spreading generator of PLL4, in order to reduce the amount of EMI peaks.</description>
                <bitOffset>2</bitOffset>
