              </field>
              <field>
                <name>DIVPEN</name>
                <description>PLL4 DIVP divider output enable
Set and reset by software to enable the pll4_p_ck output of the PLL4.
Cleared by hardware when entering a Stop mode or Standby.
In order to save power, when the pll4_p_ck is not needed, DIVPEN must be set to '0'.</description>
                <bitOffset>4</bitOffset>
