            <description>This register may be separately and securely write-protected at a field level, as detailed in
the following register fields description.
This register is used to set the peripheral clock enable bit of the corresponding peripheral. It
shall be used to allocate a peripheral to the MPU. Writing '0' has no effect, reading will return
the effective values of the corresponding bits. Writing a '1' sets the corresponding bit to '1'.</description>
