This bit reflects the BKPSRAM block secure state, as configured via the corresponding DECPROT[1] field of the ETZPC register.</description>
                <bitOffset>8</bitOffset>
                <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
                <access>read-only</access>
                <enumeratedValues>
